notesEn:
Visual refactor of the panel display layer (pure styling, zero behaviour change):
1) Injects a standalone <style id="dsh-config-sync-theme">, loaded idempotently; no Tailwind / shadcn / Google Fonts, no new dependencies;
2) Magazine-editorial look: masthead eyebrow (DSH PLUGIN · CONFIG SYNC + version), chapter eyebrows (01 · Status … 10 · Feedback), hairline rules, monospace metadata;
3) Jump bar switched from pill buttons to underlined tabs (2px brand underline + bold on the active section);
4) Cards lift on hover with a gradient top hairline; sections enter with a staggered fade-up (55ms steps); warn/error chips breathe;
5) All colours come from host --dsw-alias-* tokens so light/dark follow automatically; prefers-reduced-motion fully degrades.
Interfaces, request bodies, state predicates, copy strings and section order are identical to 0.4.25 (selftest 416 checks, clientcheck all green, deep render 0 failures).
